//- The Lemon slide catalogue: every template in lemon.scss, with each one's alternates stacked under it. Copy from here when you need a pattern; docs/LEMON-DECK.md says what each one is for.
//-
//- Not part of any talk's build. To judge a pattern in the real deck, include this file at the end of pug/index.pug for a while, then take the include out again. Every slide carries data-timing="0" so the speaker view's pacing timer ignores it.
//-
//- One family per partial in catalogue/. Each opens with a divider; right is the next template, down is its alternates.

section.divider(data-timing="0")
  h2 Examples
  p Every Lemon template, with its alternates underneath.
  p Disposable: take the include out before the talk.

include catalogue/_say.pug
include catalogue/_code.pug
include catalogue/_define.pug
include catalogue/_media.pug
include catalogue/_registers.pug
include catalogue/_transitions.pug
